{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:00.20]Lex Luger on the beat\n[00:03.22]It's Swerve WRLD, bitch\n[00:04.58]Swervo, what you on nigga?\n[00:07.34]G-G-Gas Team\n[00:10.48]Skrrt\n[00:12.14]Ha-ha\n[00:14.24]Uh\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD & G Herbo]\n[00:14.42]Uh (Yeah), he know (Yeah)\n[00:15.72]Ain't with the fighting at all (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:17.22]Gun on my hip, that's my cheat code (Yeah)\n[00:19.02]Two Percs, I'm nodding off (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:20.62]I'm in Dior having a ball (Ball)\n[00:22.24]Me and Swerv', we gon' ball (Ball)\n[00:23.94]So much money, can't spend it all (All)\n[00:25.66]Big ole .40 in my drawers (Drawers)\n[00:27.50]All my demons sinister, uh (Yeah)\n[00:29.06]Someone get a minister, uh (Yeah)\n[00:30.98]Blue pills to the face (Yeah)\n[00:32.50]Pour up the lean to finish it off (Yеah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:34.50]Feel like Lеnny Kravitz (Kravitz)\n[00:35.58]In some Gucci glasses (Glasses)\n[00:37.60]Goddamn, that boy stylish (Stylish)\n[00:39.02]Hollow points, that boy wildin' (Wildin', uh)\n[Verse 2: G Herbo & Juice WRLD]\n[00:41.58]All my young niggas grew up wildin', CJ kept it silent\n[00:43.64]So much money that's coming, keep piling (Uh)\n[00:44.96]Put 250 off in an island\n[00:45.66]Say he from the east side, pull his file then\n[00:46.74]Running everything past on the island\n[00:48.48]Niggas was violent, used to be a child then\n[00:49.56]Three hundred thousand, whips, no mileage (Err)\n[00:50.86]And I'm dripping all in sauce like Alton\n[00:52.14]You get money, dial in\n[00:53.02]Get money, don't worry about niggas, don't get too much money\n[00:54.74]You get money, smile then, you pussy\n[00:56.76]Fuck nigga and you must be hatin' on me\n[00:57.86]You say I'm broke, how I am?\n[00:58.80]This rap shit fuel too many ho niggas\n[01:00.34]Every day, I be ready to throw the towel in\n[01:01.92]Gorillas, wolves when we howling\n[01:03.76]Gotta feed 'em, they stomachs growling\n[01:04.72]On the hunt, you don't eat if you don't kill nothin'\n[01:06.18]Get yo' ass up, make a nigga proud then (Yeah)\n[Verse 3: Juice WRLD]\n[01:07.18]Uh, make me proud (Make me proud)\n[01:07.88]My niggas on the prowl (On the prowl)\n[01:09.10]Pull up in that Ghost (Ghost)\n[01:09.86]My crib look like a haunted house, uh (Haunted house)\n[01:10.94]Smoking loud (Loud)\n[01:11.38]Yo' weed don't make a sound (At all)\n[01:12.60]What, you got a seven? (A seven?)\n[01:13.28]I'm smokin' out the pound (Out the bitch)\n[01:14.58]Ayy, yo (Yo)\n[01:14.84]My niggas on the roll (On the roll)\n[01:16.04]If it's about the dough ('Bout the dough)\n[01:17.12]We gon' lose control, ayy (Lose control)\n[01:18.78]Oh, I had to let you know (Ayy, oh, let you know)\n[01:20.32]Load the choppa up (Load the choppa up)\n[01:21.60]Cock it back and let it go (Let it go)\n[01:22.62]I put a brick on my wrist, dancing\n[01:30.16]Clean ass nigga with some dirty Fanta (Uh-huh)\n[01:31.10]Feel like a dog in the Rick Owens (Uh-huh)\n[01:31.96]Your bitch did all of the clique, she going (Yeah)\n[01:32.94]Your bitch did all of the coke, it's snowing (Yeah)\n[01:34.04]Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh, ya' know (Know)\n[01:34.78]Big money, CEO, business suit with a Draco (Oh)\n[Outro]\n[01:35.74]G-G-Gas Team","words":[[0.2,0.34,"Lex"],[0.46,0.58,"Luger"],[0.76,0.84,"on"],[2.88,2.98,"the"],[3.02,3.18,"beat"],[3.22,3.28,"It's"],[3.32,3.54,"Swerve"],[3.58,3.64,"WRLD,"],[3.72,4.04,"bitch"],[4.58,4.94,"Swervo,"],[5.0,5.12,"what"],[5.2,5.26,"you"],[5.38,5.42,"on"],[5.5,7.28,"nigga?"],[7.34,7.74,"G-G-Gas"],[7.82,8.0,"Team"],[10.48,11.74,"Skrrt"],[12.14,14.16,"Ha-ha"],[14.24,14.28,"Uh"],[14.42,14.48,"Uh"],[14.52,14.68,"(Yeah),"],[14.94,15.02,"he"],[15.16,15.36,"know"],[15.4,15.66,"(Yeah)"],[15.72,15.8,"Ain't"],[15.94,16.02,"with"],[16.06,16.12,"the"],[16.2,16.48,"fighting"],[16.54,16.64,"at"],[16.7,16.86,"all"],[16.98,17.06,"(Yeah,"],[17.1,17.18,"yeah)"],[17.22,17.3,"Gun"],[17.36,17.4,"on"],[17.44,17.48,"my"],[17.52,17.62,"hip,"],[17.94,18.1,"that's"],[18.16,18.26,"my"],[18.36,18.52,"cheat"],[